sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator
    participant UI as Next.js Workbench
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant LLM as OpenAI-compatible provider
    participant Tools as Governed tools
    participant DB as Postgres audit state

    Operator->>UI: Run investigation for TCK-1042
    UI->>API: POST /tickets/TCK-1042/agent-runs
    API->>LLM: Request bounded investigation plan
    LLM-->>API: Evidence targets and planned actions
    API->>API: Verify plan contract
    API->>DB: Trace plan.investigation and plan.verify
    API->>Tools: read.billing_evidence
    Tools->>DB: Load invoices, charges, credits, policy
    DB-->>Tools: Evidence references
    Tools-->>API: Structured evidence summary
    API->>Tools: decision.refund_eligibility
    Tools-->>API: Duplicate charge eligible
    API->>LLM: Draft internal note and customer reply
    LLM-->>API: Draft-only text
    API->>DB: Trace draft and create approval request
    API-->>UI: Completed run with pending approval
    UI-->>Operator: Decision Overview and Safety Rail
